<title>USA: J.B. Hunt OKs pay package boosting wages.</title>
<headline>J.B. Hunt OKs pay package boosting wages.</headline>
<dateline>LOWELL, Ark. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.B. Hunt Transport Services Inc said Thursday it reached a compensation package for its truck drivers that will boost driver wages by 33 percent.</p>
<p>The package takes effect February 25, 1997, the firm said.</p>
<p>J.B Hunt said it expects a net savings in the first year with increasing savings in subsequent years.</p>
</text>
